%% ASTRA — Sequence: Preemptive Healing Loop
%% Render at: https://mermaid.live

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant KPI as KPI Stream
    participant BUF as KPI Buffer\n(30-sample window)
    participant AE as LSTM Autoencoder\nAnomalyDetector
    participant FC as ForecastHead\nSeq2Seq on Latent
    participant PH as PreemptiveHealer
    participant CLF as AnomalyClassifier
    participant TW as Digital Twin\nM/M/1 Simulator
    participant ENG as HealingActionEngine
    participant E2C as E2 RC Client
    participant WS as WebSocket Hub
    participant UI as React NOC Dashboard
    
    Note over KPI,UI: === PREEMPTIVE HEALING LOOP (runs in parallel, 60s horizon) ===
    
    loop Every 1 second (when window ready)
        KPI->>BUF: Push KPI sample
        BUF->>BUF: Maintain sliding window (30×6)
        
        par Reactive Path
            BUF->>AE: window
            AE-->>BUF: mse, per_feature, attention
        and Preemptive Path
            BUF->>FC: window (normalized)
            AE->>FC: latent_vector (8-dim from encoder)
            FC->>FC: Autoregressive decode\n300 steps × 6 KPIs
            FC-->>PH: ForecastResult\n{trajectory[300,6], risk_curve[300], preemptive_alert, seconds_to_anomaly, confidence, at_risk_kpis, summary}
            
            alt Preemptive Alert (risk_curve[0:60] > 2σ threshold)
                PH->>WS: FORECAST_UPDATE event\n{preemptive_alert, seconds_to_anomaly, at_risk_kpis, confidence, risk_curve_60s, summary}
                WS->>UI: Update ForecastPanel — ⚠ ALERT banner
                
                PH->>CLF: evaluate(forecast, window)
                CLF->>CLF: Classify predicted anomaly type
                CLF-->>PH: anomaly_type, confidence
                
                PH->>TW: simulate_action(candidate, current_kpis, projected_mse)
                TW-->>PH: SimResult{approved, improvement, queue_metrics}
                
                alt Twin Approves Preemptive Action
                    PH->>ENG: execute_raw(action_type, params, mode="PREEMPTIVE")
                    ENG->>E2C: send_control(action_type, params)
                    E2C-->>ENG: {sent: true}
                    
                    WS->>UI: HEALING_APPLIED (preemptive)\n{action_type, params, mode: "PREEMPTIVE", forecast_confidence}
                    UI->>UI: Show preemptive heal badge
                    
                    Note over PH,UI: MTTR effectively NEGATIVE —\nhealed before anomaly materialized
                else Twin Rejects
                    PH->>WS: ESCALATION (preemptive rejected)
                    WS->>UI: Show escalation
                end
            else Nominal Trajectory
                PH->>WS: FORECAST_UPDATE event\n{preemptive_alert: false, confidence, summary: "✓ NOMINAL"}
                WS->>UI: Update ForecastPanel — green status
            end
        end
    end
    
    %% ForecastHead Internal Detail
    Note right of FC: ForecastHead Architecture:\n- Frozen encoder (8-dim latent)\n- 2-layer LSTM decoder (32 hidden)\n- Linear(16→6) per timestep\n- Teacher-forced training\n- Horizon: 300 steps (5 min)\n- Alert window: 60 steps (60s)
    
    Note right of PH: PreemptiveHealer Logic:\n1. Forecast risk curve\n2. If alert within 60s:\n   a. Classify predicted anomaly\n   b. Get candidate action\n   c. Simulate in twin\n   d. If approved → execute\n3. Broadcast forecast to dashboard